{"id":"n60863-1-14","stage":2,"title":"끝내 · 一直","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60863-1-14-1","ko":"잃어버린 내 자전거를 끝내 찾지 못했어.","zh":"我丢失的自行车最终还是没找回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잃어버린","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버린","audio":"/audio/870c0d8437bddb80f7e4.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"자전거를","meaning":"自行车","explanation":"자전거：自行车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자전거","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62517","senseId":"1","lemma":"자전거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자전거를","audio":"/audio/9a4a3197c77572031111.mp3"}},{"text":"끝내","meaning":"一直，始终","explanation":"끝내：一直，始终。","readings":[{"term":"끝내","audio":"/audio/5322c2e0ad9c097d577c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60863","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝내","audio":"/audio/5322c2e0ad9c097d577c.mp3"}},{"text":"찾지","meaning":"取回，找回","explanation":"찾다：取回，找回；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"4","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾지","audio":"/audio/37dbddc0d4b6fac8d513.mp3"}},{"text":"못했어.","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못했어","audio":"/audio/7af8720619399029eb0a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"91e88e6f412fe193","term":"자전거","zh":"自行车","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3","entryId":"62517","definition":"人的座驾，用两只脚踩使轮胎转动前进。","pronunciation":["자전거"]},{"id":"5322c2e0ad9c097d","term":"끝내","zh":"一直，始终","audio":"/audio/5322c2e0ad9c097d577c.mp3","entryId":"60863","definition":"直到最后。","pronunciation":["끈내"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"取回，找回","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"曾经失去、被夺走、寄存的或借出的东西再次收回。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7482c8410598b1a7814.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60863-1-14-2","ko":"저런. 새 자전거를 사든가 해야겠구나.","zh":"哎呀，看来得买辆新自行车了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런.","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀。","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}},{"text":"새","meaning":"新的","explanation":"새：新的。","readings":[{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17884","senseId":"1","lemma":"새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}},{"text":"자전거를","meaning":"自行车","explanation":"자전거：自行车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자전거","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62517","senseId":"1","lemma":"자전거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자전거를","audio":"/audio/9a4a3197c77572031111.mp3"}},{"text":"사든가","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；든가：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사든가","audio":"/audio/12aa0ffe209bb313d751.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠구나.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠구나","audio":"/audio/f8269aca46bd33b93c09.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"e2d38c50201cf36d","term":"새","zh":"新的","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3","entryId":"17884","definition":"不是已有的，而是第一次出现的。","pronunciation":["새"]},{"id":"91e88e6f412fe193","term":"자전거","zh":"自行车","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3","entryId":"62517","definition":"人的座驾，用两只脚踩使轮胎转动前进。","pronunciation":["자전거"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做，干","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c601efdcae331281cba1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60863","la